# Copy to .env.<mode> (for example .env.production) or set in the build environment before `npm run build`.
# The API address the browser calls, version included. /api/v1 (keep it set): the web app's own address (nginx in
# Docker, Vite in dev forward it to the API). Change it only for an API at another address (e.g.
# https://api.example.com/v1); the API must then list this web app's origin in its CORS_ORIGINS.
# The login cookie is SameSite=Strict, so such an API must be on the same site (e.g. app.example.com and
# api.example.com); on another site the browser never sends the cookie and every request answers 401.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1
